<!-- A trefoil knot: one ribbon woven over and under itself three times, the agents' shared work. The path is the
     classic trefoil curve (sin t + 2 sin 2t, cos t − 2 cos 2t) fitted to the box. At each crossing the strand below is masked
     away and a short dash of the same path is redrawn on top, so the weave alternates over and under with no seams. -->
